          "text": "Jo Naputali pe guryemo jo ma gibedo i Bet-cemec ki Bet-anat, ento gubedo i kin jo Kanaan ma gin wegi lobo-nu. Kadi bed kumeno, guketo jo Bet-cemec ki Bet-anat i tic muroni.",
